ltiple storage configurations, Dell PERC RAID controllers, PCIe expansion, and iDRAC remote management, the PowerEdge R530 provides a practical platform for virtualization, databases, file and backup storage, hosting, CCTV/NVR applications, and enterprise IT infrastructure.</p><p><br></p><h3>Key Features:</h3><p><br></p><ul><li>Dell PowerEdge R530 2U Rack Server</li><li>Intel Xeon E5-2600 v3/v4 processor support</li><li>Dual-socket server architecture</li><li>DDR4 ECC memory support</li><li>Flexible HDD and SSD storage options</li><li>Dell PERC RAID controller support</li><li>PCIe expansion capability</li><li>Gigabit Ethernet networking</li><li>Integrated Dell iDRAC remote management</li><li>Reliable 2U rackmount design</li><li>Suitable for virtualization and server hosting</li><li>Ideal for storage-intensive applications and data centers</li></ul>\n              "},{"title":"Product Table","active":false,"cls":"tab-4","noExpand":false,"kind":"compat","title2":"Product List","head":["","Price"],"rows":[{"name":"Dell PowerEdge R630 Server","href":"/dell-poweredge-r630-server","now":"85,000৳","old":"90,000৳","single":""},{"name":"Dell PowerEdge R640 Enterprise Server","href":"/dell-poweredge-r640-enterprise-server","now":"170,000৳","old":"175,200৳","single":""},{"name":"Dell PowerEdge R730xd Server","href":"/dell-poweredge-r730xd-server","now":"","old":"","single":"130,000৳"},{"name":"Dell PowerEdge R740 16 Bay SFF 2U Rackmount Server","href":"/dell-poweredge-r740-16-bay-sff-2u-rackmount-server","now":"","old":"","single":"250,000৳"},{"name":"Dell PowerEdge R740xd 12 Bay LFF 2U Rackmount Server","href":"/dell-poweredge-r740xd-12-bay-lff-2u-rackmount-server","now":"","old":"","single":"270,000৳"},{"name":"Dell PowerEdge R430 Rack Server","href":"/dell-poweredge-r430-rack-server","now":"","old":"","single":"0৳"},{"name":"Dell PowerEdge R840 Server","href":"/dell-poweredge-r840-server","now":"","old":"","single":"0৳"},{"name":"Dell PowerEdge R660 Server","href":"/dell-po